Akatabo k'ekikopo kazuulibwa n'essanyu!

Okukuumibwa butereevu ku:
{0}

Obujulizi obw'okukubaganya ebirowoozo ku pulojekiti bwekuumibwa ku:

{0}

Yongera okuzimba Synix n'okukozesa ebigezo eby'amakulu nga tebannaggyayo.

GitHub koodi ey'okuyingira:

{0}

Kkoodi yakolebwa kopi ku kipande. Ssaawo OK okuggula GitHub, kozesa koodi n'okukkiriza Synix.

Ojja kuweereza ekiwandiiko kino ekya GitHub?

{0}

Okusookera ddala, weetegereze ebifo eby'okutegeeza n'okulaba nti tebirimu bubaka obw'ekyama.

Kino kijja kuggyawo enteekateeka eno: {0}
Ebyafaayo by'okufulumya ebikozesebwa ku mudduuka ono n'ebiwandiiko ebikuumibwa Synix nabyo bijja kuggibwawo.
Ebiwandiiko byonna eby'okuddaabiriza ebikozesebwa ku muddubi bisigibwa okuggyako ng'olondawo ekitundu ekiri wansi.

Okuggyawo obuyambi buno obw'olubeerera?

{0}
{1:f}

Ebiwandiiko bya server ebikozesebwa tebijja kukyusibwa.

Synix yaggibwa mu ddwaaliro eri:

{0}

Synix passwords ne Discord webhooks eziwonyezeddwa zisobola okuddaabirizibwa ku PC empya n'ekigambo kino eky'okuyingiza. Kwata ku fayiro; tekisobola kuggibwawo.

Synix yaggibwa e:

{0}

Ekiwandiiko kino tekibikkuliddwa, n'olwekyo kikwekuume mu kifo eky'ekyama. Synix enkola ey'okukozesa n'ebiwandiiko eby'oku mikutu gya webu Discord biyinza okwetaagibwa okuddaabirizibwa ku kompyuta endala.

Okukola ekiwandiiko kya {0}?

Ebiwandiiko: {1:N0}
Data ya server: {2}
Ekifo ekisukka mu kimu ekyetaagisa: {3}
Free on backup drive: {4}

Sserva ennene ziyinza okutwala ekiseera okupakisa. Ensimbi ez'enkomerero ez'okuwummuzibwa zijja kuba ntono okusinga ennamba eyogerwako.

Tewali kifo kimala okuteekawo obuyambi buno mu ngeri ey'obukuumi.

Data ya server: {0}
Ekifo ekisinga okwetaagisa: {1}
Free on backup drive: {2}

Olupapula lw'obwesige: {3}

Okuzzaawo {0} okuva mu kyuma kino?

Eyatondebwa: {1:f}
Ekiwandiiko: {2}

Ebiwandiiko bya server ebikyaliwo bijja kusasulwa. Synix y'ejja okusooka okuteekawo entegeka ey'obwesige n'okuddaabiriza fayiro ezikoleddwa mu kiseera kino singa obuggya bulemererwa. Ennyiriri z'okuweereza Synix ezikoleddwa tezigenda kukyusibwa.

Synix yasoma era n'akebera ekitundu kyonna:

{0}

Tewali kabi kazuuliddwa, era tewaaliwo fayiro yonna eyatuusibwako.

Tewali kifo kya buseere ekimala okuggyayo Synix.

{0}

Funa ekifo ekirala oba olonde ekifo ekirala w'oyinza okukikuuma, oluvannyuma gezaako nate.

{0} yeetaaga fayiro zino nga tannatandika kuweereza:

{1}

{2}

Ebisaanyizo ebyetaagisa:
{3}

Embeera: {0}
Erinnya ly'okukuuma: {1}

Synix ejja kukuuma dedicated.yaml, okukyusakyusa ekitundu ky'olunyiriri lwokka/okukuuma, era n'okukuuma ekiwandiiko kya server ekikwatagana. Enkola y'ensi eziriwo tezikyusibwa. Oyinza okukozesa enkola eno ku ntandikwa y'olukuŋŋaana oluddako?

